    "description": "Vector & Forces Museum, hall 8 — Arena. The last hall of the loop: the turret-targeting station at the entry, the walk-in reflection hall in its own walled 7x7 bay in the north-east, the vector arena in the west, and a sentry turret with a wide open dodge field in the south-east — it fires at you, keep moving. A queer cylinder target stands on a plinth mid-hall. The teleporter at the south end closes the loop back to Foundations.",
